  "fadeInDuration": 2,
  "greetingText": "你好，我是米霍尔。",
  "playerReplyText": "你要做什么？",
  "concernText": "你怎么了？你看起来好像不太好",
  "freeDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "我想……我可能要请你离开这里。我没有恶意，但是这件事说起来十分复杂",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_149ycwsgf7",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 28800
      },
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然时间不够了，但还有一些时间。我需要想想这件事应该从哪说起？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_qmmmckiuej",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "也许应该从十年前，那时我居住的地方非常糟糕。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_sfhbsh82no",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你肯定难以想象那是一个什么样的地方，即使是如今的我也不愿意主动回忆。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_ilx7eq455a",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是现在情况有点不同，所以我必须把这件事告诉你。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_15wojpd89u",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那个地方几乎很少见到阳光，大家似乎有很多烦恼，每个人的脸上都不太平静。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_klbhr2p5hv",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但我不知道他们的烦恼是什么，我年纪很小，只知道自己经常生病。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_41g4wuhsb7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我的病不只有一种，有时候会肚子疼，有时候会走不了路……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_beng373wrt",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以，大部分时候我都一副无精打采的样子。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_oa19j89pgj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "stomachWaterHold": 1,
  "stomachTurnDuration": 6,
  "stomachDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [
        "你的话好像还没说完。",
        "你感觉怎么样？"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_zxsxiem5xi",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 25200
      },
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "难道我们被一只大怪兽吞进肚子里了？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "确实非常大。",
        "也许我比你清楚大怪兽长什么样……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_npllgzed42",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么会这样，我的人生就像忘记涂彩的陶器一样残缺。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "你怎么了？",
        "你能不能把话说清楚。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7id2bgwjwd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "看呐！看我的胸前，这个不知疲倦的倒计时。等倒计时结束，我就会马上爆炸成七八百块，威力足以把一整颗行星炸碎！",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [
        "爆炸表演吗？收费吗？",
        "今天怪事真多。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_uh2xm70wzu",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你不明白……我真想像戏剧的主角那样尽兴地独白。不应该这样……明明我已经拼尽全力了。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7pcczfersi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "明明我已经检查过了，这个星系不应该有人，我们也不应该被关在这个肚子里。不应该这样！",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_eektw4y9ro",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是已经没有时间解释了，现在就是故事里分秒必争的危局。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_sw20xsg68j",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我一定不会让我的人生这么可悲地收尾，等一下，等我一下，我马上就能想到办法出去。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [
        "……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_3ncz4cf0em",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null
      ]
    }
  ],
  "countdownEnabled": 1,
  "countdownInitialSeconds": 300,
  "countdownInitiallyVisible": 0,
  "countdownStartOnTalk": 1,
  "countdownWarningSeconds": 30,
  "countdownBrightness": 4,
  "countdownHalo": 0.12,
  "countdownWidth": 0.12,
  "countdownHeight": 0.032,
  "countdownOffsetX": 0,
  "countdownOffsetY": 0,
  "countdownColor": "#FF4D2E",
  "countdownWarningColor": "#FF160B",
  "printingPoleCueConfigured": true,
  "printingDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "嘿！我想到办法了。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [
        "什么办法。",
        "我在听。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rlejw_pgx1ith7k9",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 5940
      },
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "看这里，我飞船上有一根超长关节，就像西哈斯神话里的通天柱。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_0s8q7u6rbh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [],
      "showPole": true
    },
    {
      "text": "原本是用来将飞船悬挂在不方便停泊的地方，或者是潜入……某些……地方……",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_yrqohdvvk1",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "总之！只要我们用这个杆子去捅这个大家伙的肚子，让它觉得不舒服。也许……它就会将我们吐出去！",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [
        "也许？",
        "好阴险。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rs1ln_1y4yq56mf8",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "我明白……这确实不算太高明的办法……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_l37clzgacc",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是哪有不荒诞的传奇！不会很痛，肯定没有被炸成碎片痛。如果是这家伙，恐怕有七八百千万块碎片。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_qyggik2vuy",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "不过现在有一个问题，飞船被吞进来的时候摔掉了一个构件，我倒是有图纸，只是不知道该怎么做出来。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [
        "等我一会。",
        "知道了，我有办法。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rv83v_1atazmsmuq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    }
  ],
