  "foolsGroundDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_e9nj8bvyq9",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "没有效果……还打扰了一群奇怪的东西……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_b36y85n23x",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是还有办法！只要这家伙饿了肯定得张嘴吃东西，那时我们就可以出去。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_kn5ku26shs",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是你看我们的周围，这些乱七八糟的东西是不是正占着它的肚子。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_9octlxlb8m",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsWalkDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "所以你也别闲着了，我们一起把这些东西扔出去，让它快点消化掉。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_bro1g3pnp1",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "它马上就会饿得“ru~ru~”地叫，说不定到时我们还要捂住耳朵呢。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_xb4927aeor",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这些一点也不多，以前我被街区老大强迫干活时，比这辛苦多了。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_omtfsq85cd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那家伙总是用铁拳套抵着我的下巴，问我:“小树枝，你害不害怕？”",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_mm9d785vzg",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我当然不怕他……腿也不会抖……眼皮子也不会跳……当然……！",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_wh913bivfm",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "只是为了保住他的面子……我每次都会大声哭出来……",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_xrvuzspnql",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我的哭声很难听，所以他们听到我哭就会离我远一点。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_c3oesajzoj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但有时候我很累哭不出来，就会被揍一顿……也有可能是两顿。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_w7u6exa4dn",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那些家伙喜欢用谷地垃圾山的废品做各种拳套，所以被揍时身上每个地方的感受是不一样的。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_rvmoecv0wa",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "就像一盒巧克力里有不同口味。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw7uvhe6_2jcxqsh4jf",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsCrestDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……？",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_gyahmnqdde",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这家伙……为什么……为什么……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_mnyt6e0c2v",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么吃这么多！",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_d9ys6p0cqh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsSceneFadeDuration": 1.2,
  "foolsSettlementFadeDuration": 1,
  "foolsClosingDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "…………",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_crn8awwbie",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么你这么冷静？戏剧大师们最讨厌你这种观众！莫修斯德会夹着嗓子让你“滚出去！”。",
      "duration": 10,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_eh7crjxcx9",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你不觉得这么死掉很傻吗？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_y1ths0ll03",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你明明什么也没有做，你只是路过这里，今天本该是平常的一天。如果梦里再捡到两颗宝石，那就最完美不过了。",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_1f6p80czg6",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "现在却遇到这样的傻瓜炸弹狂和傻瓜大怪兽，然后像个傻瓜一样被困在肚子里被炸死。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_ak8w3vrweq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是！你的表情告诉我！这种傻瓜死法你并无所谓！你的生命意义到底是什么？",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_9jul5x0bu7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_y126ecd5k6",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "对不起，我不该这么说，我的人生才是真正没有意义。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_jvzb4qqxu5",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "永远只能被欺负怎么会有任何意义呢？也许我更需要正义。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_j95sl7je4v",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是他们一边揍我一边说”能力就是正义“。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_owx9t6v0v0",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "于是后来当我发现自己很有盗窃天赋后，我也理直气壮地去盗窃别人。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_anu3zq7xbi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我觉得这就是在”兑换我的正义“。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_etihiue5lq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "一直到后来，我去偷窃红油麦田的守卫，那家伙是不折不扣的好人，因为他就在我的眼前拼了命去救被揍的人。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_q2pp68bgc9",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那时我才发现他做的事才能被叫做”正义“！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_nkrlxubedy",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "于是，我也想去做一件“真正正义”的事情，我决定去偷科技公司的能源核心。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_ln80ylvt9p",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那个东西能帮助好多人，他们正在被饿死，那家公司却不给穷人用，这绝对是一件”正义“的事。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_kazjd5ktuv",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是，我失败了，然后就被植入了这颗炸弹，这是惩罚。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_7jsp367xjh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "罚我远离任何人，也罚任何人远离我。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_9tp8ttv0xz",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "如果我就独自找个无人知晓的地方死掉，也算是用这颗炸弹盛大告别我无意义的人生。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_c7vl4tb4lj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是如果还要带上你和这只大怪兽的生命，那是对我人生意义的彻底否定。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw8iz6rc_4raqcppt7i",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以，我不能让你们因为我被炸死在这里。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_tnx1mkizh6",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这绝不是我的“正义”！",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_l4odl7u8vd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "escapeFlightDuration": 32,
  "escapeExitDistance": 12000,
  "escapeHullLoss": 36,
  "escapeFadeDuration": 1.2,
  "escapeGravesDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "这就是你们地球死的时候要建造的东西吗？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_6e8z4sfd8p",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 1800
      },
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "哈哈，现在我们可以等死了。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_rivtznj5am",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_lki56hbr4m",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "其实从刚进来的时候我就特别在意这个东西。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_w5grby62w3",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "看起来很迷人不是吗？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_zo0oi7dcm8",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [],
      "pullSprout": true
    },
    {
      "text": "……？这个东西好像连着什么？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_xznhfqrgsf",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_uydph4gsng",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么回事！？",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_vfossn0fwb",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这个大家伙好像张嘴了，我们快趁这个时候出去！",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_r0t6nr976g",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你的飞船动不了吗？相信我！跟紧我！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_0c4g94xdqj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "escapeEncouragement": [
    {
      "text": "抓紧，我来带路！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_dad5fxf4g5",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "跟着我的航线，别担心！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_38jx8wedvp",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "前面有障碍，我来撞开！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_pioe0l8dye",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "还撑得住，我们继续！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_q4ulde42bt",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "就快到出口了，坚持住！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_r1lickwgrp",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "看到亮光了，我们能出去！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_hzqd9f7ww4",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "最后一段路，抓稳！",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_od5ytmjzgb",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "farewellChestDuration": 4,
